  "text": "Stop manually editing hundreds of spreadsheet cells one by one late at night. Staring at imported CSV files with jumbled names, extra spaces, and mismatched dates drains your energy. Manual text corrections produce typos, corrupting your customer records and preventing your summary charts from updating. Open Google Sheets, highlight your dataset, and select Data Cleanup suggestions to auto-format names and dates. You clean entire contact databases in three clicks.",
